  "entry": {
    "__typename": "show_show_Entry",
    "id": "2071218",
    "title": "Dubquake Records",
    "extract": "Cutting-edge dub and reggae powered by O.B.F Sound System.",
    "description": "<p>Founded by O.B.F Sound System, Dubquake Records has established itself as one of the driving forces in contemporary dub and reggae. Based in Lyon (FR), the label’s mission is to nurture and expand sound system culture through its musical output, events and documentary films.</p>\n<p>Dubquake parties are held twice a year at L’Usine in Geneva (CH), a renowned autonomous cultural center. Since 2006, these sessions have offered a unique sound system experience that draws a dedicated international audience and inspired the creation of the record label in 2014. The Dubquake experience is now expanding beyond, with events taking place in Paris and around the globe.<br />On air since 2024, Dubquake brings its cutting-edge dub and reggae to Rinse France.<br /></p>",
    "slug": "dubquake-records",
